  "releaseNotes": "Version 2 release featuring:\n      - High-performance, incredibly fast SAS7BDAT file reading with minimal memory allocation\n      - Support for extended observation counter format (SAS 9.3+)\n      - Async enumeration with cancellation support\n      - Memory-efficient streaming using Span<T> and Memory<T>\n      - Automatic decompression (RLE and RDC)\n      - Comprehensive encoding support",
